etics</strong> like chicken colors, beaks,\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 wattles, and feet!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027260/extras/bcd239b5a98455856d7ea7fcf01032ed.webp?t=1763056686\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0Utilize Very Powerful Power-ups to assist in your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027260/extras/bcd239b5a98455856d7ea7fcf01032ed.webp?t=1763056686\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0Test your abilities in the <strong>NEW Challenge Mode</strong>, where one hit = instant death!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027260/extras/bcd239b5a98455856d7ea7fcf01032ed.webp?t=1763056686\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0Compete in daily leaderboards for best scores in <strong>Normal</strong> and <strong>Challenge</strong> Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027260/extras/bcd239b5a98455856d7ea7fcf01032ed.webp?t=1763056686\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0Customize your chicken to be as cute or cursed as you desire\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027260/extras/bcd239b5a98455856d7ea7fcf01032ed.webp?t=1763056686\" width=16 height=16 /></span>\u00a0Unlock 39 BEHEMOTH Achievements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"